00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:46.700
It's a competition between
selected members of each legion.

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:49.080
Want to trade places, Yuri?

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:51.410
They say experience is the best teacher.

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:52.950
She can't!

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:57.290
Yuri isn't used to her CHARM yet.
What will you do if she gets hurt?

00:13:57.290 --> 00:13:59.080
Fine, fine.

