00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:43.870
"Alfheim second years"
"Amano Soraha" "Banshoya Ena"

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:43.870
They just can't help themselves.

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:44.870
"Alfheim second years"
"Amano Soraha" "Banshoya Ena"

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:44.870
Must be nice.

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:45.120
Must be nice.

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:47.580
Yuyu?!

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:49.200
Now!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:54.040
Would you take this more seriously?

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:55.250
How careless!

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:57.000
You're wide open, Gropius!

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.330
Pipe down!

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:02.450
I'd really rather be fighting Yuyu myself,

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:05.000
but I'll make do with you today!

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:06.290
Oh, yeah? Take this!

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:08.500
Phase Transcendence!

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:12.040
It's all the same if I dodge!

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:15.080
Thank you for evading that.

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:24.750
Miriam's Phase Transcendence takes the win!

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:26.250
Phase what?

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:28.910
Well, when I get a bit serious,

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:31.160
this is no...

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:35.750
Rescue squad, hurry!

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:45.040
You went for a pretty flashy finish, huh?

00:15:45.830 --> 00:15:46.080
"Arsenal Division second year"
"Mashima Moyu"

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:51.910
"Arsenal Division second year"
"Mashima Moyu"

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:51.910
Now, next, I set up everything
for your exhibition match myself,

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:54.160
so dance your heart out, Gropi.

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:59.200
What do you take my Phase
Transcendence for, Miss Moyu?

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.120
Huh?

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:06.910
It's a kind of risky Rare Skill that
releases all a Lily's Magie at once, right?

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:13.500
Meaning that, as you see,
my Magie's run dry. I'm through for today.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:14.500
What?

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:17.620
What am I supposed to do?! Do you
know how much I prepared for today?!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:20.830
I'm sorry! I got a trifle carried away!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:25.160
Still, there must be
someone else who's suitable.

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:35.910
H-Hey, what's going on?!

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:39.080
What it looks like--the
afternoon exhibition match.

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:42.410
It was supposed to be
a special match between Miriam

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:45.120
and a Huge-roid Moyu
made for her research, but...

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:48.620
Yup. I registered her to fill in for Miri.

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:49.660
But...!

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:53.290
It's something Moyu made,
so it should be fine, right?

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:56.080
Isn't it worrying <i>because </i>Moyu made it?

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.790
Oh, dear. Looks like I'm too late.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:09.410
Oh, Miss Moyu! Please do something!

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:13.120
Well, this cage won't open
until the match is over.

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:15.120
Yuri just has to win, right?

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:20.370
It's an exhibition, so of course
it's set up for the Lily to win.

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:21.910
It is, isn't it?

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:23.750
No, just the opposite.

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:27.250
I tuned it up to take down Gropi no problem.

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:28.450
Yuri's in danger!

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:30.700
What did you have planned for me, Miss Moyu?!

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:32.290
Wait, it's too late to panic!

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:34.620
I call it Mecha Rumpelstilzchen!

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:37.080
You named it?! You must really like that thing!

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:42.330
Isn't being the rookie who
does reckless things my job?!

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.120
Times have changed.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:49.660
Yes. The mysterious beauty Yuri has
completely replaced you in Yurigaoka gossip!

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:51.290
You, too, Fumi?!

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:55.000
Riri! I'm going to do it!

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:57.700
Yuri.

00:17:57.700 --> 00:18:00.450
I want to be a Lily, too.

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:04.910
I want to become a Lily
and get to know you all better.

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:07.040
So, watch me!

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:10.540
Believe in her, Riri.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:13.290
That girl is watching you.

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:16.040
You should watch her, too.

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:19.540
That's...

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:21.750
Miss Yuyu's stance.

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:41.450
Fall back when it presses you!

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:44.450
"Third years"
"Rosalinde Friedegunde von Otto" "Tamura Nagi"

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:44.450
Yes. Your opponent's
rhythm is there to be broken.

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:48.950
Don't stop moving. If you can
make an opening, you can win!

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.830
Everyone...

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:11.080
Riri, you remember when I first
taught you the basics, don't you?

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.120
What came first?

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:14.200
Yes.

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:18.080
Deliberately take the hit,
deflect it, and strike.

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:20.580
That's right. Look.

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:26.200
Deliberately take the hit,

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:27.950
deflect it...

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:31.160
...and strike!

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:35.250
Yes!

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:37.910
Oh. Excuse me.

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:45.790
Riri, everybody, did you see?!

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:49.500
I did it!

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:52.370
Great job, Yuri!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:55.250
There, there. Don't cry, Riri.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:58.870
My poor Mecha Rumpelstilzchen.

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:00.830
That's enough of that.

