"This year's best Lily"             "Wang Yujia"

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:21.040
"Weekly Lily News"
"Best Lily Decided!"
"Congratulations, Wang Yujia"

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:57.950
I received Yuri's DNA results
from the analysis department.

00:21:57.950 --> 00:21:59.450
And?

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:05.450
Her DNA... is definitely that
of an average human woman.

00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:11.120
But there's something unnatural.
Like it's <i>too </i>average.

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:15.000
It's natural for a normal human to
have some abnormalities, but she...

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:17.500
Just the gist, please.

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:26.830
My conclusion is... that she's
an individual derived from Huge.

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:31.120
So, she's a Huge that became human.

00:22:31.120 --> 00:22:33.040
You're not surprised?

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:37.660
Unfortunately, they stole a march on us.

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:41.410
The research organization G.E.H.E.N.A.
and the CHARM manufacturer Grand Guignol

00:22:41.410 --> 00:22:47.580
reported the "loss" of a "test subject"
they were jointly researching to the UN.

00:22:47.580 --> 00:22:54.790
They claim she was born using
stem cells made from Huge.

00:22:54.790 --> 00:22:57.950
A synthetic Lily.

00:22:57.950 --> 00:23:01.450
What a disgusting expression.

00:23:02.500 --> 00:23:05.040
Is it possible?

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:09.330
Through multi-layer genome duplication, Huge DNA

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:14.910
is said to contain the DNA
information of all life on Earth.

00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:21.250
That obviously includes humans.
Some academics compare it to Noah's Ark.

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:26.870
So, I don't know how they did it,
but it is theoretically possible.

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:30.450
It's completely unethical and illegal.

00:23:30.450 --> 00:23:34.750
And they went so far as to
expose their own misconduct

00:23:34.750 --> 00:23:39.620
in order to demand we return her to them.

00:23:39.620 --> 00:23:41.080
What will we do?

00:23:41.080 --> 00:23:48.120
If she isn't human, the academy
loses its basis for protecting her.

00:23:49.200 --> 00:23:52.750
The head of the CHARM
manufacturer Grand Guignol

00:23:52.750 --> 00:23:56.160
is Kaede Johan Nouvel's father.

00:23:59.040 --> 00:24:01.330
Hello,

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:03.120
Father?

